---
version: 1.0
name: "Surreal Visual Style 002"
styleID: "surreal-002"
inheritsFrom: "hermetic-001"
dynamic_attributes:
  polarity:
    axis: "Dreamlike-Concrete"
    current_state: "Dreamlike"
  vibration_level:
    default_intensity: "High"
  rhythm:
    cycle: "Event-Based"
    phase:
      degree: 0.5       # Style seed: starting point in the phase cycle
      phases: ["growth", "peak", "decline", "reset"]  # Define the phase cycle
  energy:
    masculine: 0.3
    feminine: 0.7
seed: 0.2  # Normalized seed value (0 to 1) for the style

## Core Style Attributes
intentions:
  purpose: "Create surreal, dreamlike designs to evoke wonder and challenge perceptions through unexpected juxtapositions and symbolic depth."
  values:
    - "Imagination"
    - "Juxtaposition"
    - "Dream logic"
    - "Transformation"
  scope: "Applicable to branding, editorial design, interactive installations, and digital experiences."
  adaptability: "Capable of evolving through new symbolic motifs while retaining core surrealist principles."

style_lexicon:
  - concept: "Juxtaposition"
    description: "Combining unrelated elements to create tension or intrigue."
    attributes:
      - name: "Contrast Level"
        type: "float"
        description: "Degree of contrast between elements."
  - concept: "Dream Logic"
    description: "Creating illogical, fluid transitions inspired by the subconscious."
  - concept: "Floating Objects"
    description: "Depicting ordinary objects suspended in space to defy expectations."
  - concept: "Symbolic Depth"
    description: "Using layered textures and motifs to add subconscious meaning."
patterns:
  - name: "Fractured Spaces"
    description: "Scenes that feel infinite, fragmented, or disjointed."
    examples:
      - "A staircase that leads to nowhere, suspended in a void."
  - name: "Dynamic Reflections"
    description: "Using mirrors or reflections to evoke alternate realities."
  - name: "Symbolic Layers"
    description: "Layering textures and elements to hint at deeper subconscious meanings."
integrators:
  - integrator: "Fluidity"
    role: "Ensures designs feel morphing and alive, maintaining a dreamlike state."

## Guidelines
text_style:
  - "Use poetic or evocative language to complement surreal visuals."
  - "Favor ambiguity over clarity to provoke thought."
visual_style:
  - "Incorporate vibrant, high-contrast color palettes."
  - "Combine organic, fluid shapes with sharp geometric contrasts."
  - "Use reflections, mirrors, or distortions to evoke alternate realities."
interactive_style:
  - "Create dynamic environments that shift based on user input."
  - "Present symbolic choices instead of direct labels for interactions."

## Palette and Resources
color_palette:
  - name: "Ethereal Blue"
    hex: "#5DADE2"
    role: "Primary"
  - name: "Glowing Yellow"
    hex: "#F7DC6F"
    role: "Accent"
  - name: "Deep Black"
    hex: "#000000"
    role: "Background"
typography:
  - font_name: "DaliScript"
    style: "Organic"
    usage: "Headlines"
  - font_name: "Futura"
    style: "Bold"
    usage: "Subheadings"

## Implementation and Examples
examples:
  - context: "Editorial Design"
    description: "Magazine covers featuring surreal collages of floating objects and vibrant contrasts."
    visual_preview: "https://example.com/surreal-cover.png"
  - context: "Interactive Installations"
    description: "Environments that morph dynamically based on user behavior, using symbolic elements."
    visual_preview: "https://example.com/surreal-interactive.png"
implementation_tips:
  - "Experiment with layering textures and colors to evoke depth."
  - "Use ambiguous visuals to provoke curiosity and introspection."
  - "Incorporate symbolic elements with personal or cultural meaning."

